   "body": "**Added to the scope (operator feedback, 2026-11-07, `ext/francoisgn-suborch-1`)**\n\nThe operator finds the Catégories list visually flat. It is the only list in the app that uses `.listStyle(.sidebar)` (`ForumListView.swift:22`): no separators, no row background. The legacy app used a default `List` with icons (`MainWindow.swift:129-232` @ 2440d79).\n\nAdditional acceptance criterion for this rebuild: use an explicit **inset-grouped** style, consistent with the MP list and Settings. If collapsible sections stay, use a manual header disclosure: `Section(isExpanded:)` targets sidebar lists. On iPad, check the column look, and branch on size class, not on idiom.\n\nThis issue is part of the visual consistency umbrella. It stays in its milestone, never M5.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
